#: src/model/w42-template.c:315
msgid "Present:"
msgstr "出席："

#: src/model/w42-template.c:315
msgid "Who was there"
msgstr "出席人员"

#. Translators: in the notes of a meeting, who sent word that they
#. * could not attend.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:318
msgid "Apologies:"
msgstr "请假："

#: src/model/w42-template.c:318
msgid "Who was not"
msgstr "请假人员"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:321
msgid "Matters discussed"
msgstr "讨论事项"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:322
msgid "The first matter."
msgstr "第一项事项。"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:323
msgid "Decisions"
msgstr "决定"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:324
msgid "What was decided, and by whom it will be done."
msgstr "决定了什么，由谁负责落实。"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:342
msgid "The Title of the Novel"
msgstr "小说标题"

#. Translators: under the title of a novel, what the book is.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:344
msgid "A Novel"
msgstr "长篇小说"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:345 src/model/w42-template.c:408
msgid "Chapter One"
msgstr "第一章"

#. Translators: Heading 1 is a style's name, which is not
#. * translated.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:348
msgid ""
"The first lines of the book go here. The paragraphs are justified and set "
"in, as a printed novel's are, and each chapter starts on a new page: give "
"its title the Heading 1 style."
msgstr ""
"在此处输入本书的开头。与印刷的小说一样，段落两端对齐并首行缩进，每章从新的一"
"页开始：请为章标题应用 Heading 1 样式。"

#. Translators: Tools, Language, Set Language, Default and Word Count
#. * Goal are the menus, menu items and button of those names: use the
#. * words the translated menus and dialog use.
#: src/model/w42-template.c:355
msgid ""
"Tools ▸ Language ▸ Set Language, Default makes the book's language the one "
"its spelling, quotation marks and hyphenation follow; Tools ▸ Word Count "
"Goal sets how long it is to be."
msgstr ""
"“工具 ▸ 语言 ▸ 设置语言”中的“默认”按钮可将本书的语言设为拼写、引号和断字所依"
"据的语言；“工具 ▸ 字数目标”可设置本书的目标篇幅。"

#: src/model/w42-template.c:361
msgid "A new scene begins after a break like the one above."
msgstr "新的场景从类似上面的分隔之后开始。"

